WEBVTT

00:01:57.836 --> 00:02:01.236
that, have faith in God,
but tie your camel first.

00:02:01.556 --> 00:02:02.716
As a dad,

00:02:02.756 --> 00:02:06.116
I felt utterly hopeless
with Nusayba's cancer.

00:02:06.156 --> 00:02:08.836
I'm the dad, I'm supposed to fix things.

00:02:08.836 --> 00:02:10.836
But I couldn't fix cancer.

00:02:10.876 --> 00:02:13.796
Cancer plays for all the marbles.

00:02:13.836 --> 00:02:18.036
It's a relentless, brutal,
remorseless killing machine.

00:02:18.076 --> 00:02:20.756
It does not care
about your vacation plans.

00:02:20.796 --> 00:02:22.756
It does not care about your bucket list.

00:02:22.796 --> 00:02:24.876
It does not care about your Netflix queue.

00:02:24.916 --> 00:02:27.836
It comes for everything.

00:02:27.836 --> 00:02:29.796
Then, coronavirus.

00:02:29.836 --> 00:02:31.036
Awesome.